ontent": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le01ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Simple Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.<br/> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.<br/> Irregular verbs change in different ways.<br/> For questions in the past, you use the auxiliary <span class=\"italic\">did</span> followed by the verb in the base form, like <span class=\"italic\">Did you ask \u2026 ?</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">Did</span> is the past form of <span class=\"italic\">to do</span>."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to spill \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"spilled\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to copy \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"copied\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to like \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"liked\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to help \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"helped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"had\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was, were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to meet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"met\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to tell\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"told\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "How did you get the promotion?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I guess he liked my report."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Future Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Future tense talk actions in the future. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "The auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">will</span> goes before the verb. The short form is <span class=\"strong\">\u2018ll</span>.<br/><br/>You use the Future tense when you talk about intentions, make offers or make predictions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'll be an assistant in the marketing department. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will work in communications."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "free time"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "time without responsibilities"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We had some free time to explore. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "colleague"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person you work with "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Last week I had a problem with a colleage"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "communications"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "formal messages from a company or institution, in writing or through the media"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I work in communications, marketing and design."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "assistant"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who helps another person in an office"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is your assistant angry that I spilled coffee?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "efficient"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "works quickly and accurately"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are an efficient worker"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "focus group"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a meeting organized by a business to understand people's opinions. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You'll also plan focus group sessions. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "social media"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "popular online tools used to share messages, photos and videos with many people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll create documents and post them on social media."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to post"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to upload something to the Internet, like a message or image"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I post documents on social media."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose 10 words you learned from this lesson."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain the meaning of each word in your words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find a word search website."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Enter your words into the program."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner to find the words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner to prepare another word search."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I choose 10 new words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain the meaning of each word."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I prepare a word search."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share the word search with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}